{
  "displayName": "Pixel canvas : vue d'ensemble",
  "gridLayout": {
    "columns": 2,
    "widgets": [
      {
        "title": "",
        "text": {
          "content": "## Application serverless\nFonctions et services Cloud Run : trafic, erreurs, latence, instances. Un service = une fonction du projet (proxy, discord-proxy, draw-pixel, get-pixel, create-snapshot, render-grid, admin-cmd, front).",
          "format": "MARKDOWN"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "",
        "text": {
          "content": "**Corrélation d'une requête** : chaque requête porte un `correlation_id` qui traverse proxy, Pub/Sub et workers. Dans *Logs Explorer* : `jsonPayload.correlation_id=\"<id>\"` (le proxy le renvoie dans sa réponse et dans l'en-tête `X-Correlation-Id`).",
          "format": "MARKDOWN"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Requêtes par seconde, par service",
        "xyChart": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "metric.type=\"run.googleapis.com/request_count\" AND resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_RATE",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                    "groupByFields": [
                      "resource.label.service_name"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s"
            }
          ],
          "yAxis": {
            "label": "req/s",
            "scale": "LINEAR"
          },
          "timeshiftDuration": "0s"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Erreurs 5xx par seconde, par service",
        "xyChart": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "metric.type=\"run.googleapis.com/request_count\" AND resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\" AND metric.label.response_code_class=\"5xx\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_RATE",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                    "groupByFields": [
                      "resource.label.service_name"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s"
            }
          ],
          "yAxis": {
            "label": "req/s",
            "scale": "LINEAR"
          },
          "timeshiftDuration": "0s"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Latence p95 par service (ms)",
        "xyChart": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "metric.type=\"run.googleapis.com/request_latencies\" AND resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_PERCENTILE_95",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_MAX",
                    "groupByFields": [
                      "resource.label.service_name"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s"
            }
          ],
          "yAxis": {
            "label": "ms",
            "scale": "LINEAR"
          },
          "timeshiftDuration": "0s"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Latence p50 par service (ms)",
        "xyChart": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "metric.type=\"run.googleapis.com/request_latencies\" AND resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_PERCENTILE_50",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_MAX",
                    "groupByFields": [
                      "resource.label.service_name"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s"
            }
          ],
          "yAxis": {
            "label": "ms",
            "scale": "LINEAR"
          },
          "timeshiftDuration": "0s"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Instances par service (montée en charge)",
        "xyChart": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "metric.type=\"run.googleapis.com/container/instance_count\" AND resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_MAX",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                    "groupByFields": [
                      "resource.label.service_name"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s"
            }
          ],
          "yAxis": {
            "label": "instances",
            "scale": "LINEAR"
          },
          "timeshiftDuration": "0s"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "CPU des conteneurs, p95 (saturation)",
        "xyChart": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "metric.type=\"run.googleapis.com/container/cpu/utilizations\" AND resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_PERCENTILE_95",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_MAX",
                    "groupByFields": [
                      "resource.label.service_name"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s"
            }
          ],
          "yAxis": {
            "label": "0 à 1",
            "scale": "LINEAR"
          },
          "timeshiftDuration": "0s"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "",
        "text": {
          "content": "## Files d'attente (Pub/Sub)\nLa file amortit les rafales : sous charge, les messages attendent au lieu d'être perdus. Un retard qui grandit = les workers ne suivent pas ; un message en DLQ = un échec après toutes les tentatives (10 pour les pixels).",
          "format": "MARKDOWN"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "",
        "text": {
          "content": "**Rejeu** : les souscriptions gardent leurs messages 7 jours (`seek` pour rejouer). Les messages en échec attendent dans les souscriptions `*-dlq-hold` ; `scripts/replay_dlq.py --queue pixel` les remet dans la file d'origine.",
          "format": "MARKDOWN"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Messages en attente, par souscription",
        "xyChart": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "metric.type=\"pubsub.googleapis.com/subscription/num_undelivered_messages\" AND resource.type=\"pubsub_subscription\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_MEAN",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                    "groupByFields": [
                      "resource.label.subscription_id"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s"
            }
          ],
          "yAxis": {
            "label": "messages",
            "scale": "LINEAR"
          },
          "timeshiftDuration": "0s"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Âge du plus vieux message en attente (s)",
        "xyChart": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "metric.type=\"pubsub.googleapis.com/subscription/oldest_unacked_message_age\" AND resource.type=\"pubsub_subscription\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_MAX",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_MAX",
                    "groupByFields": [
                      "resource.label.subscription_id"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s"
            }
          ],
          "yAxis": {
            "label": "secondes",
            "scale": "LINEAR"
          },
          "timeshiftDuration": "0s"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Messages en file d'erreurs (DLQ)",
        "xyChart": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "metric.type=\"pubsub.googleapis.com/subscription/num_undelivered_messages\" AND resource.type=\"pubsub_subscription\" AND resource.label.subscription_id=monitoring.regex.full_match(\".*-dlq-hold\")",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_MEAN",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                    "groupByFields": [
                      "resource.label.subscription_id"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s"
            }
          ],
          "yAxis": {
            "label": "messages",
            "scale": "LINEAR"
          },
          "timeshiftDuration": "0s"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Messages publiés par topic",
        "xyChart": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "metric.type=\"pubsub.googleapis.com/topic/send_message_operation_count\" AND resource.type=\"pubsub_topic\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_RATE",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                    "groupByFields": [
                      "resource.label.topic_id"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "LINE",
              "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s"
            }
          ],
          "yAxis": {
            "label": "msg/s",
            "scale": "LINEAR"
          },
          "timeshiftDuration": "0s"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "",
        "text": {
          "content": "## Données et métier\nFirestore (un document par pixel), pixels refusés par la limite de débit, échecs de snapshot.",
          "format": "MARKDOWN"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "",
        "text": {
          "content": "La limite de débit abandonne les pixels au-delà du quota par minute et par utilisateur : une hausse brutale est un signe d'abus ou d'un pinceau qui sature le quota.",
          "format": "MARKDOWN"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Firestore : requêtes par méthode (transactions, commits, lectures)",
        "xyChart": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "metric.type=\"firestore.googleapis.com/api/request_count\" AND resource.type=\"firestore.googleapis.com/Database\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_RATE",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                    "groupByFields": [
                      "metric.label.api_method"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              },
              "plotType": "STACKED_AREA",
              "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s"
            }
          ],
          "yAxis": {
            "label": "req/s",
            "scale": "LINEAR"
          },
          "timeshiftDuration": "0s"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Firestore : requêtes par code de réponse (ABORTED = contention)",
        "xyChart": {
          "dataSets": [
            {
              "timeSeriesQuery": {
                "timeSeriesFilter": {
                  "filter": "metric.type=\"firestore.googleapis.com/api/request_count\" AND resource.type=\"firestore.googleapis.com/Database\"",
                  "aggregation": {
                    "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_RATE",
                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                    "groupByFields": [
